      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think calculating the property value using regex is error-prone. It is correct now, but what if in the future we updated the enum to use other math operation other than plus?\n\nWhen making the AIDL interface, the build system automatically generate the cpp and java files for the interface, e.g. out/soong/.intermediates/hardware/interfaces/automotive/vehicle/aidl_property/android.hardware.automotive.vehicle.property-V3-java-source/gen/android/hardware/automotive/vehicle/\n\nCan you use a host java app to directly read the enum value out and write to json instead?",
      "revId": "47e177597b4549cf62c86f2bff2753e707f5fb04",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
